All parameters and attributes changed to pointers (WorkUnit*, Mediator*, EmployeeComponent*)

EmployeeComponent:
added constructors and virtual destructor
added getName()
added setMediator(Mediator*)
prepare(), perform(), finish() made virtual and protected

Employee, Manager, EmployeeProfession, EmployeeCompetency:
added constructor taking name
added copy constructor

EmployeeDetail:
added destructor that deletes wrapped
override getName(), compareProfession(), setMediator() to delegate to wrapped
wrap() pushes new component to the innermost slot

EmployeeProfession, EmployeeCompetency:
registerX() returns a stable id, reusing deleted slots
deleteX() leaves an empty slot so ids do not shift

Requires:
WorkUnit::getName(), WorkUnit::getRequiredProfession()
Mediator::notifyColleagues(EmployeeComponent*, string)
